      "trackName": "Wrist Pet",
      "description": "Wrist Pet – Raise a Tiny Cat or Dog on Your Apple Watch\nMeet your new furry best friend—right on your wrist! Hatch an egg and discover whether it’s a playful kitten or a loyal puppy. Care for your pet as it grows up in real time: feed it, clean it, play together, and don’t forget bedtime (10 PM sharp!).\n\nYour pet meows or barks for attention, gets moody when ignored, and evolves based on how well you care for it. The better the care, the cuter the pet!\n\n - Choose between a cat or a dog\n - Real-time growth and moods\n - Built just for Apple Watch\n - Bonus iPhone app for stats and progress",
